{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、冒頭あいさつと\n終わりの挨拶を選ぶ時間がなくて\n選べませんでした。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からまたやります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は川後さんとになと3人で\nFLASHスペシャルさんの\n撮影がありました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の陽菜・日奈・日奈子で\n撮影！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"ひな\"といえば！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです！あれです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い私服っぽい衣装をきて\n公園に行ったり\nあれっぽい衣装を着て畳のお部屋で\n撮影したりと\nとても楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売は2月26日です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしていてください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14枚目シングルの個別握手会が\nこんなに早い段階から3部も完売に\nなったことをききました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく驚いて\n嬉しくてついつい「3」ってやって\n笑ってる写真をメールで送っちゃった♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全会場4部制ということで\nこんなに多い部数は今までなかったし\n前の握手会を思い出すと辛かったことも\n泣き出しそうになったこともあったけど\n今は皆さんが会いに来てくださると思うと\nまだまだ先の握手会のことを思い描いて\n♪なにを着よう～♪どんな髪型にしよう～\nってたくさんたくさん考えちゃいます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、まだまだ先はあるし\n私の力が足りてないところもたくさんあって\n不安だけど、\n皆さんと直接触れ合えて気持ちを伝えられる\n握手会という大切な場所を\nもっともっと幸せに楽しんでもらえるように\nがんばります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14枚目の個別握手会で今の所\n着る予定の物をざっとかきます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月17日  in幕張メッセ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬇︎ セーラー服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月30日   inポートメッセなごや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬇︎  天使or悪魔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月5日    in京都パルスプラザ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬇︎   天使or悪魔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月15日   in東京ビックサイト"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬇︎  バスケットユニフォーム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！！！たくさん部数があるので\n皆さんのご要望にたくさんこたえたい！\nと思ってるので\n着て欲しい洋服ややってほしい髪型など\nぜひ教えてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のあとの\nエア握手会風の写真\nいつのまにか載せなくなってた！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までヒナコセレクト(仮)\nという名前だったコーナーを\n前まで質問返しをしていたコーナーの\nきいちゃんにきいちゃおう！\nという名前のコーナーにします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！いきなりですが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆はやぶささん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁突然だけど北海道でしかやらない遊び、大根抜きってわかる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎大根抜きって北海道でしかやらないの？！！小学校の時やってたよ！担任の先生に教えてもらって！もしかして、担任の先生、北海道出身だったのかもしれない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆きなこ 永遠のまいみんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁トムとジェリーならどっち推し？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎トム！！！だって、いつもジェリーが勝っちゃうでしょ？\nだから、いつか公平になるように\nトムを応援する！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良く終わることもあるんだけどね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ダダダダーンさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ヒナセレ...きいちゃんはきいちゃんの個人PV(ペアPV)の中でどれが一番オススメ？\nあと、メンバー全員の中で一番のお気に入りの個人PV(ペアPV)は何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎どれも、お気に入りです♪\n9枚目の初めての個人PVでは\nゲームみたいになってて面白いし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目のドラゴン剣は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素の私が所々で見えるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11枚目のまあやさんとのペアPVは\n2人の生態が見えて、\nみんな違ってみんな良いって思うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12枚目の未央奈とのPVは\n堀北コンビの関係がみえたり\nじょしらくの舞台稽古真っ最中の撮影で\nマイクついてるのに声が張り気味で\n緊張して力んでる日奈子がクスクスっとなるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13枚目のキタノがキタノ ヒナコはコナイは\n新しい自分を表現できてるんじゃないかな！と思うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部全部オススメです(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、他のメンバーですきなPVは\n個人PVだとみなみさんの\nお願い！マイ☆ハートで\nペアPVだとみり愛と絢音の\n時空超越アイドル イマガールがすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆タクマさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁僕は来年就職で動物関係の仕事に就こうと思っています！！！きぃちゃんは動物の番組とか見ますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いいですね！素敵です！\n動物の番組はよくみます！！！\n笑ったり癒されたり泣いたり\n勉強ですね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ナエトルこうすけさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁金縛りにあったことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎あります！！！よくなります！！！\nでも、金縛りって疲れちゃうから\n嫌な時はなる直前で防御したり\nなってもすぐにとけるように\nしてます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ヒビナさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんはコーヒー飲める？飲めるなら飲みやすい\nコーヒー教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎あまり苦いのは飲めない！！！\nMAXコーヒーは甘くて飲みやすいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ひーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ブログ毎日書いてるから、だいぶブログ書くの早いと思うけど、何分ぐらいかかってんの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うーん、朝起きて携帯開いてから\nブログ送るギリギリまで１日を使って\n書いて保存書いて保存を繰り返してるから\nどのくらいかかってるかわからない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆メガシャキさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁新幹線とか飛行機のリクライニングは倒す？それとも倒さない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎たおす！！！\n後ろの人に断ってからね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ぐっちゃんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きぃちゃんはホラー映画とかは見ますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎みますよ！！！ホラー映画もホラー映像も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、最近みてないな～\nおやすみの日に借りに行こうかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆まさっぴさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きぃちゃんはチップと散歩とかする？？\nなんかね、うまく散歩するコツがあるんだって！！！\n何だと思う？？(￣▽￣)ﾆﾔﾘｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは、｢散歩中はワンちゃんと目を合わさずに前を向いて歩く｣です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎お散歩いくよ～！\n今日もお仕事終わってお家に着いたあと\nお母さんとチップと3人で行ってきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へー！！そうなんだ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、日奈子は散歩中いつも\nチップが可愛すぎてついつい名前呼んで\n振り向かせたくなるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、チップって呼んで\n振り向くとより一層幸せな気持ちに\nなれるからオススメだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ヒロ氏さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんはお寿司屋さん行ったら何から頼む？\n自分は絶対サーモン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎まぐろ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休憩がてらに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね！\nポニーテールしてみたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃんっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でも、今度するね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/29/9348165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「セレクトする番号について！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆だーいきさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ヒナコだから175番目のコメント！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎候補！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あしゅきい。ひかるさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁222番の人とかは？どう？乃木坂の誕生日！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎候補！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆つよぽんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ヒナセレに選ぶコメ番は乃木坂46にちなんで46番とかはどうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎候補！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆トシさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ブログ更新お疲れ様！必ず返すコメント番号821番はどう？乃木坂の結成日で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎候補！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆鹿さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁1月28日なら129\n12月25日なら1225ととか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎候補！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆名古屋のくまモンさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁あとは717番目とか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎候補！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーっとじゃあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊「175」(ひなこ)が1番多かったので\n「175」番目のコメント。\n(例)  175、1175...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊「更新日の月と日にちをくっつけた数字」\n(例)   今日だと1月28日だから\n「128」番目のコ